philosophical tenets|[sound:3-15a.mp3]\n{phyi rol pa'i grub mtha'/} Philosophical tenets, philosophies of the “outsider” (schools)\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-15b.mp3]\n {nga tsho'i rgan lags kyis phyi rol pa'i grub mtha' yi skor zhib 'jug gnang gi yod tsang /_nga yang de tsho la dbyings tog tsam bslebs song /}  Since our professor does research about the philosophical tenets of the “outsider” schools, I’ve also become a bit interested in them. (H)
