bodhgaya|[sound:3-16a.mp3]\n{rdo rje gdan/} Bodhgaya, the Vajra Seat\nSyllables: {rdo rje/} =vajra, as in: {rdo rje theg pa/} = Vajrayāna; {gdan/} = seat, as in: {sa gdan/} = floor rug\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-16b.mp3]\n {dgun kha rtag par rdo rje gdan la rnying ma'i smon lam chen mo gcig tshugs kyi yod pa de ha go song ngas/_yin dang yin/_thengs gnyis bcar myong yod/}  Did you know that they hold a large {rnying ma/} Prayer Festival in Bodhgaya every winter? - Of course, I’ve been twice. (h)
