to divide|[sound:3-289a.mp3]\n{dbye ba/} to divide, differentiate, separate, division, differentiation\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-289b.mp3]\n {byang chub kyi sems la dbye na rigs gsum de tsho ga re ga re red zer na rgyal po lta bu'i sems bskyed byas/_ded dpon lta bu'i sems bskyed dang /_lug rdzi lta bu'i sems bskyed bcas red/}  If one were to ask what the three kinds of bodhicitta are when divided, there is the king-like bodhicitta, the ferry-man-like bodhichitta and the shepherd-like bodhicitta.
