to increase|[sound:3-292a.mp3]\n{gong 'phel gtong ba/} to increase, to cause to grow, to augment\nSyllables: {gong /} = upper, as in: {7gong sa mchog} = title of His Holiness; {'phel ba/} = to increase ({tha mi dad pa/}), as in: {dge 'dun chos 'phel/} = Tibetan poet, writer and scholar; {gtong ba/} = verbaliser, as in: {gling ga gtong ba/} = to have a picnic\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-292b.mp3]\n {nga'i bsam tshul la dus rabs nyi shu rtsa gcig la chos lugs tshang ma la gus zhabs kyi bsam pa dang spyod pa de yin gcig min gcig gong 'phel gtong dgos red/}  In my [humble] opinion, in the 21st century, we really need to grow our respect for all religious traditions, in thoughts and deeds.
