complete|[sound:3-360a.mp3]\n{rdzogs byang /} complete, perfect enlightenment, short for: {rdzogs pa'i byang chub/}\nSyllables: {rdzogs pa/} = to be perfected, completed, as in: {rdzogs chen/} = great perfection, {rdzogs rim/} = completion stage; {byang /} (here) signifies {byang chub/} = enlightenment\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-360b.mp3]\n {ngas dge bshes lags la rdzogs byang zer yag ni rdzogs pa'i byang chub kyi bsdus tshig yin min bka' 'dri zhus pa yin/}  I asked the {dge bshes lags/} whether {rdzogs byang /} was a short version of saying {rdzogs pa'i byang chub/}. (H) (h) "Exactly!", he said. (H)
