to cultivate|[sound:3-372a.mp3]\n{sems bskyed pa/} to cultivate, give rise to bodhicitta, the mind of enlightenment\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-372b.mp3]\n {rgyal sras chen po zhi ba lha yi spyod 'jug slob sbyong byas tshar ba'i rjes la dngos gnas snying thag pa nas byang chub kyi sems bskyed snying 'dod song /}  After having studied the Great Bodhisattva Śāntideva's Bodhisattvacāryāvatāra, I really felt a very deep wish in my heart to give rise to bodhicitta.
