to attain|[sound:3-484a.mp3]\n{thob pa/} to attain, to achieve, to reach, to win\nSyllables: as in: {grub thob/} = siddha, {'gro ba mi'i thob thang /} = human rights\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-484b.mp3]\n {mi slob pa'i lam ma thob sngon la yun ring po gcig sgom lam la 'bad brtson byed dgos kyi yod pa de go myong yod pas/_go myong yod/_sgom lam de zhe po gcig 'gor gyi red bsam gyi 'dug}  Have you ever heard that one needs to apply oneself on the Path of Cultivation for a long time before attaining the Path of No More Learning? -I have, I think the Path of Cultivation takes forever.
