to compete|[sound:3-485a.mp3]\n{'gran sdur byed pa/} to compete, to be competitive, to rival\nSyllables: {'gran sdur/} = competition, {'gran pa/} = to compete, rival; {sdur ba/} = to compare; {byed pa/} = verbalizer, to do, as in: {lhod lhod byed pa/} = to relax\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-485b.mp3]\n {nga tsho'i dus rabs nyi shu rtsa gcig gi spyi tshogs nang la 'gran sdur mang po byed dgos kyi yod pa de la dga' po khyon nas med/_da 'gran sdur ma byed pa'i thabs shes btsal gyi yin/}  I really dislike that in our 21st century society, we have to be very competitive. Therefore, I’ll search for ways to not compete.
