to improve|[sound:3-486a.mp3]\n{yar rgyas gtong ba/} to improve, to increase, to optimise\nSyllables: {yar/} = up, increasing, as in: {yar mar 'gro ba/} = to go here and there (lit. up and down), {yar ngo'i zla ba/} = waxing moon; {rgyas/} = increased, as in: {sangs rgyas} = Buddha; {gtong ba/} = verbalizer, to send, as in: {gling ga gtong ba/} = to have a picnic, {bsang gtong ba/} = to make a smoke offering\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-486b.mp3]\n {so so'i nyan rtsal yar rgyas btang 'dod yod na thabs lam mang po yod pa'i nang nas nga'i nyams myong gis byas na rlung 'phrin nyan yag dang brnyan 'phrin mang po lta yag yag shos red/}  If one wishes to increase one’s listening skills, among all the many methods there are, according to my experience, it’s best to listen to a lot of radio and watch plenty of TV.
