to bring about|[sound:3-487a.mp3]\n{skrun pa/} to bring about, to produce, to bring forth\n-----\nExample: [sound:3-487b.mp3]\n {nga'i bla mas ga re gsung gi yod red zer na nga tsho mi yin na deng sang nam mkha'i zla ba bar du 'phur thub kyi yod na yang so so yi sems nang la zhi bde yang dag pa gcig dkrun thub kyi yod ma red/}  What does my {bla ma/} say? (H) As for human beings - even though these days they are able to fly all the way to the moon, they are unable to bring about true peace and happiness in their own minds.
